  "description": "Dependency-free digital-signal-processing primitives for .NET: an iterative in-place radix-2 complex FFT, windowed-sinc FIR filter design (low-pass / band-pass / root-raised-cosine), a streaming FIR filter, an anti-aliased FIR decimator and image-rejecting FIR upsampler, a streaming rational (L/M) polyphase resampler for real audio and IQ, an analytic-signal frequency shifter, single-sideband demodulation from complex baseband (a readable whole-signal form and a constant-memory streaming one), a waterfall-spectrum source, and an ITU-R SM.443 occupied-bandwidth meter. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem; used by amateur-radio SDR/modem work but general-purpose.",
